{"seq":2,"slug":"cnn-architectures","title":"卷积神经网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/deep-learning/cnn-architectures","wordCount":2612,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"卷积神经网络\">卷积神经网络</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>卷积神经网络（Convolutional Neural Network, CNN）是深度学习在计算机视觉领域取得突破性成功的核心架构。与全连接网络不同，CNN 利用卷积操作来捕捉图像中的局部空间模式，通过权重共享大幅减少参数量，使得处理高维图像数据成为可能。从手写数字识别到自动驾驶中的实时目标检测，CNN 已经成为视觉智能的基础设施。</p>\n<p>本节涵盖以下核心知识点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>卷积操作与特征提取的数学原理</li>\n<li>池化层的作用与类型</li>\n<li>经典 CNN 架构的演进（LeNet → AlexNet → VGG → ResNet）</li>\n<li>迁移学习的原理与实践</li>\n<li>数据增强策略</li>\n<li>目标检测框架（YOLO 与 Faster R-CNN）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"卷积操作与特征提取\">卷积操作与特征提取</h3><p><strong>卷积（Convolution）</strong> 是一种数学运算，在 CNN 中，它通过一个小的<strong>卷积核（kernel / filter）<strong>在输入图像上滑动，计算逐元素乘积的和，生成</strong>特征图（feature map）</strong>。</p>\n<p>对于二维输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 和卷积核 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>，卷积操作定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>n</mi></munder><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(I * K)(i,j) = \\sum_m \\sum_n I(i+m, j+n) \\cdot K(m, n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 的卷积核可以检测特定方向的边缘——水平边缘、垂直边缘或对角线。网络通过训练自动学习这些卷积核的数值，低层卷积核通常学到边缘和纹理等低级特征，高层则学到更抽象的语义特征（如眼睛、车轮）。</p>\n<p>卷积层的三个关键超参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超参数</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>卷积核大小</td>\n<td>感受野范围</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 是最常用的选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>步幅（stride）</td>\n<td>滑动步长</td>\n<td>步幅 2 可使特征图尺寸减半</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>填充（padding）</td>\n<td>边界处理</td>\n<td>same padding 保持尺寸不变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>输出特征图的尺寸计算公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>P</mi></mrow><mi>S</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_\\text{out} = \\frac{H_\\text{in} - K + 2P}{S} + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_\\text{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是输入高度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是卷积核大小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是填充大小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是步幅。</p>\n<p>CNN 相比全连接网络的两大优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>局部连接</strong>：每个神经元只连接输入的一个局部区域（感受野），而非所有输入</li>\n<li><strong>权重共享</strong>：同一个卷积核在整张图像上共享参数，大幅减少参数量。例如，一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 的卷积核只有 9 个参数，却可以处理任意大小的输入</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"池化层\">池化层</h3><p><strong>池化（Pooling）</strong> 对特征图进行下采样，减小空间维度和计算量，同时提供一定的平移不变性。</p>\n<p><strong>最大池化（Max Pooling）</strong>：取每个池化窗口内的最大值。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 最大池化（步幅 2）将特征图的宽高各缩小一半。</p>\n<p><strong>平均池化（Average Pooling）</strong>：取窗口内的平均值，保留更多背景信息。</p>\n<p><strong>全局平均池化（Global Average Pooling）</strong>：对整个特征图取平均，输出一个标量。常用在网络末端替代全连接层，减少参数量并避免过拟合。</p>\n<p>近年来的研究趋势是减少池化层的使用，转而通过步幅大于 1 的卷积来实现下采样，给予网络更大的灵活性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"经典-cnn-架构演进\">经典 CNN 架构演进</h3><p>CNN 的发展历程是深度学习进步的缩影：</p>\n<p><strong>LeNet-5（1998）</strong>：Yann LeCun 设计，用于手写数字识别。包含两个卷积层和两个全连接层，共约 6 万个参数。它奠定了&quot;卷积-池化-全连接&quot;的经典范式。</p>\n<p><strong>AlexNet（2012）</strong>：Alex Krizhevsky 在 ImageNet 竞赛上以大幅优势夺冠（top-5 错误率 15.3%，比第二名低 10 个百分点），标志着深度学习时代的到来。关键创新：使用 ReLU 激活、GPU 训练、Dropout 正则化、数据增强。约 6000 万参数。</p>\n<p><strong>VGGNet（2014）</strong>：牛津大学团队提出，核心理念是<strong>用小卷积核堆叠替代大卷积核</strong>——两个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 的卷积层串联等效于一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 \\times 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 的感受野，但参数更少且非线性更强。VGG-16 有 16 个权重层、约 1.38 亿参数。</p>\n<p><strong>ResNet（2015）</strong>：何恺明等人提出的<strong>残差网络（Residual Network）</strong> 通过引入**跳跃连接（skip connection）**解决了深层网络的退化问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(x) = H(x) - x \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad H(x) = F(x) + x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>网络只需学习残差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，当最优映射接近恒等映射时，学习残差比直接学习映射更容易。ResNet 将网络深度推进到 152 层甚至更深，top-5 错误率降至 3.57%，首次超越人类水平（5.1%）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[LeNet-5&lt;br/&gt;1998&lt;br/&gt;6万参数] --&gt; B[AlexNet&lt;br/&gt;2012&lt;br/&gt;6000万参数]&#10;    B --&gt; C[VGGNet&lt;br/&gt;2014&lt;br/&gt;1.38亿参数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[ResNet&lt;br/&gt;2015&lt;br/&gt;残差连接]&#10;    D --&gt; E[后续架构&lt;br/&gt;EfficientNet/ViT]\">graph LR\n    A[LeNet-5&lt;br/&gt;1998&lt;br/&gt;6万参数] --&gt; B[AlexNet&lt;br/&gt;2012&lt;br/&gt;6000万参数]\n    B --&gt; C[VGGNet&lt;br/&gt;2014&lt;br/&gt;1.38亿参数]\n    C --&gt; D[ResNet&lt;br/&gt;2015&lt;br/&gt;残差连接]\n    D --&gt; E[后续架构&lt;br/&gt;EfficientNet/ViT]</pre><h3 id=\"迁移学习\">迁移学习</h3><p>从零训练一个深度 CNN 需要海量数据和计算资源。**迁移学习（Transfer Learning）**通过复用在大数据集（通常是 ImageNet）上预训练好的模型，将其知识&quot;迁移&quot;到新的目标任务上。</p>\n<p>常见策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>特征提取</strong>：冻结预训练模型的卷积层，只训练新的全连接分类头。适合目标数据集较小且与源数据集相似的情况</li>\n<li><strong>微调（Fine-tuning）</strong>：解冻部分或全部预训练层，用较小的学习率在目标数据上继续训练。适合目标数据集较大或与源数据集差异较大的情况</li>\n</ul>\n<p>迁移学习的经验法则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标数据量</th>\n<th>与源数据相似度</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>冻结卷积层，只训练分类头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>冻结低层，微调高层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>微调全部层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>可从头训练或微调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>迁移学习的成功揭示了一个重要事实：CNN 低层学到的特征（边缘、纹理、颜色分布）具有很强的通用性，可以跨任务、跨领域复用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据增强\">数据增强</h3><p>**数据增强（Data Augmentation）**通过对训练图像施加随机变换来人为扩大数据集，是防止过拟合的有效手段。</p>\n<p>常用变换：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>几何变换</strong>：随机裁剪、水平翻转、旋转、缩放</li>\n<li><strong>颜色变换</strong>：亮度、对比度、饱和度随机调整，颜色抖动（color jitter）</li>\n<li><strong>遮挡类</strong>：Cutout（随机遮挡方形区域）、Random Erasing</li>\n<li><strong>混合类</strong>：Mixup（两张图像的线性插值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{x} = \\lambda x_i + (1-\\lambda) x_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、CutMix（用一张图的区域替换另一张图的对应区域）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>高级方法：<strong>AutoAugment</strong> 和 <strong>RandAugment</strong> 使用搜索或随机策略自动组合增强操作，减少人工调参的负担。</p>\n<p>数据增强本质上是在告诉模型：图像的这些变换不应改变其语义标签，从而增强模型对几何和光照变化的鲁棒性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"目标检测\">目标检测</h3><p>图像分类只需回答&quot;图中有什么&quot;，而**目标检测（Object Detection）**需要同时回答&quot;图中有什么&quot;和&quot;在哪里&quot;——输出每个目标的类别和边界框坐标。</p>\n<p><strong>Faster R-CNN（2015）</strong>：两阶段检测器的代表。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>区域提议网络（RPN）</strong>：在特征图上滑动小网络，为每个位置生成多个候选区域（anchors）</li>\n<li><strong>分类与回归头</strong>：对每个候选区域进行类别分类和边界框精修</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Faster R-CNN 准确率高，但速度较慢（推理时间约几十毫秒/帧）。</p>\n<p><strong>YOLO（You Only Look Once）</strong>：单阶段检测器的开创者。</p>\n<p>YOLO 将检测任务视为一个回归问题：将图像划分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\times S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的网格，每个网格单元直接预测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 个边界框及其置信度和类别概率。所有预测在一次前向传播中完成，因此速度极快。</p>\n<p>YOLOv1（2016）到 YOLOv8（2023）的演进中，准确率和速度不断提升。YOLO 系列在实时检测场景（自动驾驶、视频监控、工业质检）中应用广泛。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>准确率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Faster R-CNN</td>\n<td>两阶段</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>精度优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YOLO</td>\n<td>单阶段</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>实时检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSD</td>\n<td>单阶段</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>平衡场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>参数计算</strong>：一个卷积层的输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64 \\times 64 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>（高×宽×通道），使用 32 个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 的卷积核，步幅为 1，padding 为 1。计算输出特征图的尺寸和该层的参数量（包含偏置）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>感受野分析</strong>：三个连续的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 卷积层（步幅均为 1）的等效感受野是多大？与一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7 \\times 7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 卷积层相比，哪个参数更少？各自有什么优势？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>迁移学习实验</strong>：使用 PyTorch 中的预训练 ResNet-18，通过微调在 CIFAR-10 数据集上训练一个分类器。比较从零训练和微调在收敛速度和最终准确率上的差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>架构理解</strong>：ResNet 中的跳跃连接如何缓解梯度消失问题？尝试从反向传播的角度分析：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(x) = F(x) + x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial H}{\\partial x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的最小值是多少？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>开放讨论</strong>：Vision Transformer（ViT）在大数据集上已经超越了 CNN。你认为 CNN 在未来是否会被完全取代？CNN 的归纳偏置（局部性、平移不变性）在哪些场景下仍然有价值？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>CNN 可视化</strong>：Jason Yosinski 等, &quot;Understanding Neural Networks Through Deep Visualization&quot;（2015），展示了 CNN 各层学到的特征，帮助建立直觉。</li>\n<li><strong>ResNet 原文</strong>：Kaiming He 等, &quot;Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition&quot;（CVPR 2016），残差网络的奠基论文，必读。</li>\n<li><strong>YOLO 系列</strong>：Joseph Redmon 等, &quot;You Only Look Once: Unified, Real-Time Object Detection&quot;（CVPR 2016），目标检测领域的里程碑。</li>\n<li><strong>实践指南</strong>：cs231n.stanford.edu（Stanford CS231n），李飞飞团队的计算机视觉课程，包含大量 CNN 相关的作业和笔记。</li>\n<li><strong>架构搜索</strong>：Mingxing Tan &amp; Quoc Le, &quot;EfficientNet: Rethinking Model Scaling for CNNs&quot;（ICML 2019），用 NAS 自动搜索最优的 CNN 架构缩放策略。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>卷积神经网络通过卷积操作的局部连接和权重共享，高效地从图像中提取层次化的特征。从 LeNet 到 ResNet 的架构演进展示了深度网络设计的核心思想：更深的网络可以学习更抽象的特征，但需要残差连接等技术来保证训练的可行性。迁移学习和数据增强使得 CNN 在数据有限的场景下也能发挥强大威力。目标检测框架（Faster R-CNN、YOLO）则将 CNN 的能力从分类扩展到了空间定位，开辟了更广阔的应用空间。尽管 Vision Transformer 正在挑战 CNN 的统治地位，CNN 的设计理念和工程经验仍然是理解现代视觉 AI 不可或缺的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"卷积神经网络","id":"卷积神经网络"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"卷积操作与特征提取","id":"卷积操作与特征提取"},{"level":3,"text":"池化层","id":"池化层"},{"level":3,"text":"经典 CNN 架构演进","id":"经典-cnn-架构演进"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移学习","id":"迁移学习"},{"level":3,"text":"数据增强","id":"数据增强"},{"level":3,"text":"目标检测","id":"目标检测"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"神经网络基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/deep-learning/neural-network-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"序列模型与Transformer","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/artificial-intelligence/deep-learning/sequence-models"}}